\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\ul\b YORUMUM:\ulnone\b0  Ya\'fea, varol arkada\'fe; eline, diline, y\'fcre\'f0ine sa\'f0l\'fdk! Alt\'fdn\'fd ziynet yada banka grAlt\'fdn tasarruf hesab\'fd olarak, borsadan bin kat kazan\'e7l\'fd ve sa\'f0l\'fdkl\'fdd\'fdr. Tesad\'fcfi borsa kazanc\'fdn\'fdn arkas\'fdndaki g\'f6r\'fcnmez borsa mafyas\'fd sizi ya \'f6ld\'fcr\'fcr, yada kar arifesinde (dip y\'fckseli\'fe veya tepe d\'f6n\'fc\'fe) (garda\'fe\'fdn\'fdz, pederiniz, ortak/arkada\'fe da olsa) \i "ya sen ya ben \'f6lecek"\i0  paparas\'fdyla engellemeye manda-zoru mecbur tutulacakt\'fdr. Hep alt\'fdnda kal\'fdn, sak\'fdn d\'fcnya katil borsa mafyas\'fdna bula\'femay\'fdn; alt\'fdndan \'e7\'fdk\'fd\'fe\'fdn\'fdz sadece iyi kira geliri sa\'f0layacak d\'fckkan sat\'fdn al\'fdm\'fd i\'e7in olsun; harcayamad\'fd\'f0\'fdn\'fdz kira fazlas\'fdyla yine alt\'fdn hesab\'fdna katk\'fdlay\'fdn. Deval\'fcasyon-katliam borsas\'fd d\'fcnya talimatl\'fd gayr\'fdme\'feru tough-gay'lerinin sadece 7/24 k\'fdsa/uzun popo-sat\'fd\'fe vahiy-tiyo masal\'fdd\'fdr, aldanmay\'fdn, d\'fc\'femeyin, bula\'femay\'fdn \'feerefsiz ibnirospulara... Halk-sekt\'f6r\'fc, \'fdslah-borsa vb popo-sat\'fd\'fe sap\'fdklar\'fdndan (Tanr\'fdTrump cakal\'fd da olsa) kenar durun; bi marifet-kerametleri varsa buyursun k\'f6\'fee olsun da sana sadece i\'feg\'f6renlik ihsan eylesin, ye\'f0 tut, \'fcst\'fcn\'fc poposuna t\'fdks\'fdn!..\lang1033\f2\par
